extraction check: 200 passages shared with the first corpus, min cosine 1.0000
All natural text. 540 test passages, 8640 explanations, 4 per activation.

### 1. Consensus across the 4 samples of one activation

A name is any same-type entity an explanation gives: the true one, or a wrong one (broad list, absent from the passage). Precision = share of names at that agreement level that are the true entity.

